" [:option {:value "18000962"} "Half-Lightweight (≤66 kilograms), Men"] "\n" [:option {:value "18001004"} "Lightweight (≤73 kilograms), Men"] "\n" [:option {:value "18001046"} "Half-Middleweight (≤81 kilograms), Men"] "\n" [:option {:value "18001088"} "Middleweight (≤90 kilograms), Men"] "\n" [:option {:value "18001130"} "Half-Heavyweight (≤100 kilograms), Men"] "\n" [:option {:value "18001172"} "Heavyweight (&gt;100 kilograms), Men"] "\n" [:option {:value "18001214"} "Extra-Lightweight (≤48 kilograms), Women"] "\n" [:option {:value "18001256"} "Half-Lightweight (≤52 kilograms), Women"] "\n" [:option {:value "18001298"} "Lightweight (≤57 kilograms), Women"] "\n" [:option {:value "18001340"} "Half-Middleweight (≤63 kilograms), Women"] "\n" [:option {:value "18001382"} "Middleweight (≤70 kilograms), Women"] "\n" [:option {:value "18001424"} "Half-Heavyweight (≤78 kilograms), Women"] "\n" [:option {:value "18000780"} "Team, Mixed"]] [:script {} "$('#same_games_select').change(function(){location.href='/results/' + $('#same_games_select').val();})"]] " | " [:form {:class "form-inline form-inline-header"} [:select {:name "id", :id "other_games_select", :class "form-control"} [:option {:value ""} "In other Games"] "\n" [:option {:value "900553"} "1988"] "\n" [:option {:value "17595"} "1992"] "\n" [:option {:value "18338"} "1996"] "\n" [:option {:value "19078"} "2000"] "\n" [:option {:value "19806"} "2004"] "\n" [:option {:value "260872"} "2008"] "\n" [:option {:value "316594"} "2012"] "\n" [:option {:value "355174"} "2016"] "\n" [:option {:value "2007346"} "2024"]] [:script {} "$('#other_games_select').change(function(){location.href='/results/' + $('#other_games_select').val();})"]] " | " [:a {:href "/event_names/356"} "Event type"]] [:h1 {:class "event_title"} "Heavyweight (&gt;78 kilograms), Women" [:small {}]] [:table {:class "biodata"} [:tbody {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Date"] [:td {} "30 July 2021"]] [:tr {} [:th {} "Status"] [:td {} "Olympic"]] [:tr {} [:th {} "Location"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/venues/465"} "Nippon Budokan, Chiyoda, Tokyo"]]] [:tr {} [:th {} "Participants"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/events/18001466"} "27 from 27 countries"]]]]] [:div {:class "description"} [:p {} "The results of the women’s heavyweight mixed up the expected outcome based on the ranking list. Third seed 2019 world champion " [:a {:href "/athletes/144396"} "Akira Sone"] " from Japan toppled all her mostly prominent opponents with Ippon (full point) and proceeded to the final. There, she faced " [:a {:href "/athletes/112605"} "Idalys Ortiz"] " from Cuba. Ortiz had already won medals in all her previous Olympic appearances, bronze in 2008, gold in 2012, and silver in 2016; additionally she won two World Championships. Her way into the final was less convincing, winning two bouts only by Waza-ari (half point). The final was a clash between two generations, the 21-year-old Sone against Ortiz, 11 years her senior. The end of the contest, however, was not spectacular. Sone was declared the winner after 8:52 min in the Golden Score after Ortiz was charged with a third Shido (penalty). Until this point, neither of the fighters managed to apply a technique for a score. Sone’s gold was Japan’s first gold in this category since 2004, although the country medalled at every Olympics in-between."] "\n\n" [:p {} "The experienced, second seeded " [:a {:href "/athletes/122488"} "Maria Altheman"] " from Brazil was unlucky in her third Olympics. She suffered a foot injury in the second round, when she lost by Ippon to " [:a {:href "/athletes/142749"} "Romane Dicko"] ", the 2021 World Masters winner. Unable to continue, she missed her chance in the repêchage. Dicko lost in the semi-final against Ortiz but claimed bronze in the bout against " [:a {:href "/athletes/131907"} "Kayra Sayıt"] " from Turkey. Born as Ketty Mathé in France, she changed her name to Sayıt and had already represented Turkey at the 2016 Olympics. The second bronze went to " [:a {:href "/athletes/121656"} "Iryna Kindzerska"] ", who was born in Ukraine but married an Azerbaijani and, although later divorced, still represented that country."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Competitor"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/144396"} "Akira Sone"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/JPN"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/JPN.png"}] "JPN"]] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/112605"} "Idalys Ortiz"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/CUB"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/CUB.png"}] "CUB"]] [:td {} [:span {:class "Silver"} "Silver"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "=3"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/121656"} "Iryna Kindzerska"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/AZE"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/AZE.png"}] "AZE"]] [:td {} [:span {:class "Bronze"} "Bronze"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "=3"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/142749"} "Romane Dicko"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/FRA"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/FRA.png"}] "FRA"]] [:td {} [:span {:class "Bronze"} "Bronze"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "=5"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/141710"} "Xu Shiyan"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/CHN"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/CHN.png"}] "CHN"]] [:td {}] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "=5"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/at